Project-wide license status
===========================

No project-wide open-source license has been selected for this repository.
This notice does not grant permission to use, modify, or redistribute original
project material. Files that contain their own license or copyright notices
remain governed by those notices.

Third-party code, submodules, generated IP, and game assets retain their own
licenses and terms. In particular, the DoomGeneric engine is GPL-licensed;
consult its upstream source and notices before building or distributing a
combined application. The DOOM IWAD is not included in this repository.

The repository owner must choose and add a project-wide license before the
original project code can be treated as openly licensed.
